    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Story Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After leaving home and finally reaching my destination, I was told the dungeon had already been conquered on the very same day?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireworks lit up the sky in celebration, with singing, dancing, and wine flowing freely. I had hoped to ride the fame of &quot;conquering the dungeon&quot; to prove my worth to my family, only to witness another party complete the mission on the day I arrived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no other choice, I shifted my focus and headed to a nearby village called Meadow Village to gather news of any newly discovered dungeons. But upon learning that I was born in Grave, a region known for its virility boosting magical beasts, the village chief under the guise of helping me promote my name roped me into raising the village\u2019s visibility (somehow?!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While living in the village, I found myself growing unexpectedly close to the women around me: the charmingly manipulative guild receptionist, the shy but mysterious daughter of the item shop, the weapon obsessed blacksmith apprentice, the gentle and graceful single mother tavern owner, and the unpredictable magic shop owner who keeps trying to make a move on me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/def3a6cab49d6801424ea1bf8d15b8e6.poster.avif?t=1754665259\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/def3a6cab49d6801424ea1bf8d15b8e6.webm?t=1754665259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/def3a6cab49d6801424ea1bf8d15b8e6.mp4?t=1754665259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hmm\u2026 Maybe I\u2019ll end up staying here longer than I thought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/4e15f5c84278fc2329ce999e5d062e9f.poster.avif?t=1754665259\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/4e15f5c84278fc2329ce999e5d062e9f.webm?t=1754665259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/4e15f5c84278fc2329ce999e5d062e9f.mp4?t=1754665259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/f8dce1bc4e5700825e9fe59388094821.avif?t=1754665259\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/9fe3ff81ab2f85d074f918226f973615.avif?t=1754665259\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials, level up, complete requests, and raise the village\u2019s fame all at your own pace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on requests from each shop or the guild and report back once completed. Unlock new stories and events as you explore different areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you go about your busy daily life, you'll gradually build the village\u2019s reputation and deepen your bonds with the five heroines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're in the shops, village, or outskirts, create lasting memories through fun, heartwarming, or unexpected events in your shared life together \u2665.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/f806619cf77655bfafc5f4603ecb6ffc.poster.avif?t=1754665259\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/f806619cf77655bfafc5f4603ecb6ffc.webm?t=1754665259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/f806619cf77655bfafc5f4603ecb6ffc.mp4?t=1754665259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/b2832ce493405c45cebdac0068eb4b45.poster.avif?t=1754665259\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/b2832ce493405c45cebdac0068eb4b45.webm?t=1754665259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/b2832ce493405c45cebdac0068eb4b45.mp4?t=1754665259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/c451de419ff6b66b90c13338161e9b06.poster.avif?t=1754665259\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/c451de419ff6b66b90c13338161e9b06.webm?t=1754665259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/c451de419ff6b66b90c13338161e9b06.mp4?t=1754665259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c7 Fully animated H-scenes with beautiful artwork</strong><br><strong> \u25c7 Learn various skills and use them for gathering, daily life... or lewd activities</strong><br><strong> \u25c7 Five heroines with unique personalities to pursue (or be pursued by?)</strong><br><strong> \u25c7 Raise their affection to unlock special story events</strong><br><strong> \u25c7 Full Japanese voice acting for all heroines</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Character Profiles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7 <strong>Tracy \u2013 Item Shop Assistant</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Shy and introverted, but a walking encyclopedia of the village. Beneath her modest appearance hides a secret hobby\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/fef7a719b814bdd0b3aa85705b6d6a78.avif?t=1754665259\" width=250 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7 <strong>Eli \u2013 Blacksmith Apprentice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple and honest, her eyes light up at the mention of weapons. Beyond that, she's a bit clueless\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/ed9657d7680c4bd2bac9c29a8b75555a.avif?t=1754665259\" width=250 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7 <strong>Moira \u2013 Magic Shop Owner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A sea dwelling outsider with a mischievous streak. From your very first meeting, she plays tricks on you but maybe there\u2019s more behind it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/5c0088783562995a539860b169d1c080.avif?t=1754665259\" width=250 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7 <strong>Sabrina \u2013 Tavern Owner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A gentle and elegant single mother running the tavern on her own. Always kind, but her warm smile sometimes reveals a hint of loneliness\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/80a5502a4a70b8d796e62723f087c402.avif?t=1754665259\" width=250 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7 <strong>Dorothy \u2013 Guild Receptionist</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > She charms adventurers with sweet words and cuteness, always getting them to do her bidding. But could there be a hidden agenda behind that smile\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633750/extras/c73527c9950da912e9d5557b93a34845.avif?t=1754665259\" width=250 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
